title: mnml at a glance
flow: The editor, an agent session beside it and a shell below it; the shell runs git, the Jira pane is one tab away, and the palette finds a new session in a keystroke.
# Setup, off camera: the Jira integration installed (the offline fake),
# then the composite the clip opens on — util.zig in the editor, an
# agent session on the right, a shell under it.
run integrations.show_in_dev
until INTEGRATIONS
until "Jira Work" 4000
find-click "Jira Work"
key i
until "installed jira_work" 15000
wait 4500
run integrations.open_as_tab
reset
keys @150 down down down down
key enter
until "pub fn sum"
run ai.claude_code_new_right
until "Both tests pass." 12000
run term.shell_bottom
until "tour %" 4000
slowtype "git log --oneline\n" 10
until "Start the tour project" 3000
wait 600
# The poster is the finished composite, shot just before the take, and
# the take opens on that same frame.
poster
record
slowtype "git show --stat HEAD~1\n" 14
wait 900
# Jira, one tab away in the same pane
run jira_work.open
until "JIRA WORK" 15000
heal "fetch failed" r "JIRA WORK (3)"
wait 500
keys @300 down down
key d
wait 1000
key esc
wait 500
# the palette, from the editor: a new session is one query away
run view.focus_left
wait 200
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 150
slowtype "new session" 35
wait 900
key esc
wait 500
